# Frontend language: English only

- **User → agent:** commands may be Hinglish / Hindi mixed — OK.
- **Product UI copy:** English only — web (`apps/web`, `apps/admin-web`), mobile, emails, toasts, labels, placeholders, buttons, empty states, errors shown to users.
- Do **not** put Hinglish/Hindi phrases in frontend strings (e.g. avoid "dalо", "yahan", "dubara try", "Select karo" in UI).
- Agent replies to the user may stay short Hinglish if that helps; code comments may stay English.
- Docs for agents (`flow/`, `AGENTS.md`) may use Hindi labels for clarity; shipped product strings = English.
